        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- TERMINAL LOG DIALOGUE (Tech Roadmap in Console Format) -->
    <div id="terminal" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full bg-[#0d0f17]/90 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-2xl mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 relative mt-6">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 mb-3 border-b border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-500">
        <div class="flex space-x-2">
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-rose-500 inline-block"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500 inline-block"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 inline-block"></span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-slate-400">elbai_architecture_roadmap.sh</span>
        <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">TTY_0</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2 leading-relaxed">
        <p><span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">1. elbi.de:</span> Moderne Edge-Webseite auf Cloudflare (Pages, Workers, D1 SQLite, R2 CDN &bull; sub-50ms TTFB).</p>
        <p><span class="text-purple-400 font-bold">2. AI-Automatisierungen:</span> Autonome Inventar-Synchronisation, Wiz Security Scanner &amp; Gemini Sentinel Guard.</p>
        <p><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">3. Next-Gen Tech Lab:</span> Die perfekte Synergie aus Cloudflare Edge &amp; Google Cloud Gemini Enterprise.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-500 pt-1">// STATUS: Fundament steht. Weitere coole Ideen werden kontinuierlich kompiliert und deployed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Prominent High-Visibility Docs Action Portal for Testers -->
